# Fork alignment ledger — the complete declared divergence from upstream.
#
# This file is the single source of truth for what this fork is allowed to
# change about upstream's tree. `fork/scripts/check-alignment.sh` measures the
# real divergence (from the merge-base with upstream/main) against these entries
# and fails on anything undeclared. See FORK.md § Charter for the rules.
#
# Format:  <class>  <path>  <lifetime>  <rationale>
#
#   class     add | del      — modifying an upstream-owned file is never
#                              declarable; carry it as a patch in fork/patches/.
#   path      exact path, or `dir/**` to cover a whole fork-owned subtree.
#             `del` entries must be exact paths — a deletion is checked by
#             looking the path up in the tree, and must stay deleted: if an
#             upstream merge resurrects one, the check fails until it is gone.
#   lifetime  permanent, or `until:<condition>` for divergence meant to end.
#
# Keep this list short. Every line is a liability we chose to carry.

# --- Added: fork-owned files. These cannot conflict with upstream. -----------
add  FORK.md                                     permanent  fork charter and operating model
add  fork/**                                     permanent  the fork overlay: patches, notes, docker, scripts, release gate
add  .github/workflows/build-vllm-audio.yml      permanent  builds openimage/vllm-openai-audio from the pinned tag
add  .github/workflows/fork-alignment.yml        permanent  enforces this ledger on every pull request
add  runs/**                                     permanent  gate-run artifacts stay local; only the ignore file is tracked

# --- Deleted: upstream workflows. These DO conflict on `git merge upstream/main`
# --- (modify/delete); re-delete them as part of the sync. --------------------
del  .github/workflows/add_label_automerge.yml   permanent  upstream automerge labelling; no upstream PR flow here
del  .github/workflows/issue_autolabel.yml       permanent  upstream issue triage bot; no issue tracker here
del  .github/workflows/macos-smoke-test.yml      permanent  upstream release smoke test; this fork builds no wheels
del  .github/workflows/new_pr_bot.yml            permanent  upstream PR greeter; noise on a personal fork
del  .github/workflows/pre-commit.yml            permanent  gates on the upstream lint CI this fork does not run
del  .github/workflows/stale.yml                 permanent  upstream stale bot; noise on a personal fork
del  .github/workflows/notify-ci-authorized.yml  permanent  upstream CI-command bot (arrived v0.27.x); no upstream PR flow here
del  .github/workflows/record-ci-approval.yml    permanent  upstream CI-command bot (arrived v0.27.x); no upstream PR flow here
del  .github/workflows/run-ci-command.yml        permanent  upstream CI-command bot (arrived v0.27.x); no upstream PR flow here
del  .github/workflows/buf.yml                   permanent  upstream protobuf schema publish (arrived v0.28.0); no Buf registry here
